# What must never reach the build context.
#
# `data/` above all: client audio, and AEO spec sheets and reports stamped
# "Subject to Legal Action if Disclosed Without Authorization from AEO". It is
# gitignored for the same reason, and a Docker build reads the working tree
# rather than the index — so without this line a local checkout would bake
# every recording on this laptop into an image. The style sets and the blank
# workbook reach a container through the bucket, restored at startup.
data/

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

.git/
.github/
venv/
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
htmlcov/
.coverage

# Built by the frontend stage inside the image, never copied from the host —
# a stale local dist would otherwise silently win over the one just built.
src/frontend/dist/
src/frontend/node_modules/
src/frontend/*.tsbuildinfo

# The prototype and the working notes. Neither is served.
demo/
demo.rar
Clay Design System/
handout.md
triburgProject.md
deepgram_transcript_example.md
tests/
